---
// AppRelevance.astro (Jasa Mobile App Development)
---

<section class="relevance-section">
  <div class="relevance-container">
    
    <div class="section-header animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 100ms;">
      <h2 class="header-title">Kapan Bisnis Anda Membutuhkan Mobile App?</h2>
      <p class="header-intro">
        Website sangat penting untuk akuisisi pelanggan baru, namun Mobile App adalah kunci untuk retensi, loyalitas, dan efisiensi operasional.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="comparison-wrapper">
      <!-- Website Column -->
      <div class="comparison-card website-card animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 200ms;">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="icon-box">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Cukup Gunakan Website Jika...</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span>Tujuan utama adalah informasi publik (Company Profile).</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span>Fokus pada SEO dan pencarian Google.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span>Frekuensi kunjungan user rendah (sesekali saja).</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span>Tidak butuh akses fitur hardware HP secara mendalam.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- VS Badge -->
      <div class="vs-badge animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 300ms;">VS</div>

      <!-- Mobile App Column -->
      <div class="comparison-card app-card highlight animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 400ms;">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="icon-box blue">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"></line></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Anda Wajib Membuat Mobile App Jika...</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li class="highlight-item">
            <div class="check-circle">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong>Frekuensi Penggunaan Tinggi:</strong> User menggunakan layanan Anda rutin (harian/mingguan).</span>
          </li>
          <li class="highlight-item">
            <div class="check-circle">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong>Butuh Push Notification:</strong> Harus mengirim info promo atau update status real-time.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="highlight-item">
            <div class="check-circle">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong>Fitur Hardware:</strong> Perlu scan barcode, GPS tracking, kamera, atau login Face ID.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="highlight-item">
            <div class="check-circle">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong>Akses Offline:</strong> Pekerja lapangan butuh akses input data tanpa koneksi internet yang stabil.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .relevance-section {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    padding: 100px 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .relevance-container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .header-title {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .header-intro {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #6682B3;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .comparison-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 32px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .vs-badge {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    background: #0F172A;
    border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #64748b;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .comparison-card {
    flex: 1;
    background-color: rgba(10, 22, 44, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 40px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    min-height: 400px;
  }

  .comparison-card.highlight {
    background-color: rgba(57, 132, 255, 0.03);
    border-color: rgba(57, 132, 255, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), 0 0 0 1px rgba(57, 132, 255, 0.1) inset;
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .icon-box {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: #94a3b8;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .icon-box.blue {
    background: rgba(57, 132, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .card-header h3 {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .app-card .card-header h3 {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .feature-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #7D96C5;
  }

  .feature-list li.highlight-item {
    color: #E2E8F0;
  }

  .feature-list li.highlight-item strong {
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .check-circle {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    background: var(--accent-blue);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .animate-fade-scroll {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(15px);
    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  /* Light Theme */
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .relevance-section {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .header-title {
    color: #0F172A;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .header-intro {
    color: #475569;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .comparison-card {
    background-color: #F8FAFC;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .comparison-card.highlight {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: var(--accent-blue);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(57, 132, 255, 0.1);
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .card-header {
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .card-header h3 {
    color: #0F172A;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .app-card .card-header h3 {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .feature-list li {
    color: #475569;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .feature-list li.highlight-item {
    color: #1E293B;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .feature-list li.highlight-item strong {
    color: #0F172A;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .icon-box {
    background: #E2E8F0;
    color: #475569;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .icon-box.blue {
    background: rgba(57, 132, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .vs-badge {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
    color: #94A3B8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .comparison-wrapper {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .vs-badge {
      display: none;
    }

    .comparison-card {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .comparison-card.highlight {
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .relevance-section {
      padding: 60px 16px;
    }
    
    .header-title {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .comparison-card {
      padding: 24px;
    }
    
    .card-header h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
